":"正直にいえば、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミラクルだ とか、たまたま、偶然とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思いたくないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここでそんなこと考えたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だめなんだろうなーって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分までそうやって思ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ以上は無理なんだなーって思って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん、だからそういう風に考えるのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やめました(´・ω・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果としては、そのあと順位も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落ちちゃったんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと次はリセットしよう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って考えることにしました＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この公演で数えきれないくらい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切なことを学びました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しは成長できたと思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無駄なことは一切なかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全て吸収して、これからも成長し"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続けていくための糧にする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...ごめんなさい糧の使い方って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これで合ってるんですかね(´∵｀)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみこ、ゆきな、ちま、ねね、ひめか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部みんなで出たかったね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"para